      "body": "This release is brought to you by @kossnocorp, @makstyle119 and @dmgawel.\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- [Fixed the plural form of weeks in Swedish](https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/3448).\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- [Added `yearsToDays` function](https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/pull/3540).\r\n\r\n- Added a warning about using protected tokens like `Y` or `D` without passing a corresponding option. [See #2950](https://github.com/date-fns/date-fns/issues/2950).",
